                        "name": "Kamadgiri Hill",
                        "description": "The sacred hill believed to be the wish-fulfilling form of Lord Rama."
                },
                {
                        "name": "Ram Ghat",
                        "description": "The main riverfront where Tulsidas had his divine vision."
                },
                {
