    'hp', 
    'The temple of the Vajra-Goddess, Brajeshwari Devi is one of the 51 Shakti Peethas. Located in the historic Kangra town of Himachal Pradesh, it is a site of absolute divine resilience and ancient wealth, where the left breast of Sati is believed to have fallen, representing the nurturing power of the Mother and the indestructible faith of the mountain people.', 
