    'hp', 
    'The temple of the eternal child-saint, Baba Balak Nath is a cave shrine in the Hamirpur district of Himachal Pradesh. It is a site of absolute Siddha power and protective grace, where the saint is believed to have performed intense penance, representing the eternal purity of the spirit and the absolute mastery over the senses.', 
