        "ancientLore": "Lore tells that the great saint Nagarjuna personally brought the flames from the underworld to bless the people of the Kangra valley. Another legend says that the golden umbrella offered by Akbar turned into an unknown metal as a sign that the Goddess did not accept the emperor''s pride.",
