    'baijnath-uk', 
    'Sacred Destination', 
    'uk', 
    'The temple of the Divine Physician, Baijnath is a magnificent cluster of stone temples on the banks of the Gomti river in the Bageshwar district of Uttarakhand. It is a site of absolute healing and architectural brilliance, once the capital of the Katyuri kings, where the Lord Shiva is worshipped as the master of the Ayurveda and the healer of all ailments.', 
