                        "description": "Sitting on the temple bridge to connect with the energy of the flowing mountain stream."
                }
        ],
        "highlights": [
                {
                        "name": "The Pillar-Temple",
                        "description": "The unique modern structure that keeps the ancient goddess above the river waters."
                },
                {
                        "name": "The Changing Face",
                        "description": "The miracle of the deity appearing in different ages throughout the day."
