    'Ukhimath (Winter Seat)', 
    'ukhimath-temple', 
    'Sacred Destination', 
    'uk', 
    'The winter seat of Lord Kedarnath, Ukhimath is located in the Rudraprayag district of Uttarakhand. It is a site of absolute seasonal migration and ancient Shiva-Shakti history, where the deity of Kedarnath is worshipped during the winter months, representing the eternal presence of the Lord even when the high peaks are covered in snow.', 
    '520.2', 
