                "howToReach": "Well connected by road from Rudraprayag (41km) and Rishikesh (180km). It is on the route to Chopta and Tungnath.",
                "nearestAirport": "Jolly Grant Airport, Dehradun.",
                "nearestRailway": "Rishikesh Railway Station."
        },
        "tips": [
                "Visit during the arrival of the Kedarnath doli in November to witness one of the most emotional and vibrant rituals of the Himalayas.",
                "Stay for the evening aarti; the atmosphere is intensely intimate compared to the massive crowds of the summer months.",
                "Use Ukhimath as a base to explore the nearby meadows of Chopta and the Sari village (the base for Deoria Tal)."
        ],
        "faqs": [
