), -- [REMOVED LEGACY DUPLICATE] (
    'Triyuginarayan (Wedding Temple)', 
    'triyuginarayan-temple', 
    'Sacred Destination', 
    'uk', 
    'The site of the eternal wedding fire, Triyuginarayan is the village where Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati were married in the presence of Lord Vishnu. Located in the Rudraprayag district of Uttarakhand, it is a site of absolute marital blessing and cosmic union, where a perpetual flame has been burning for three Yugas, representing the absolute commitment and the eternal bond of the spirit.', 
    '510.2', 
