                "howToReach": "140km from Rishikesh. Well connected by road; regular taxis and buses run from Haridwar and Rishikesh.",
                "nearestAirport": "Jolly Grant Airport, Dehradun.",
                "nearestRailway": "Rishikesh Railway Station."
        },
        "tips": [
