    'uk', 
    'The Himalayan seat of the Advaita philosophy, Mayavati Ashram is located in the Champawat district of Uttarakhand. It is a site of absolute intellectual silence and profound meditative energy, where Swami Vivekananda established a center dedicated purely to the non-dualistic realization, representing the absolute peak of the modern spiritual inquiry.', 
