        "ancientLore": "Lore tells that the Pandavas used the boulders of Devidhura to play a game of dice during their exile. Another legend says that the Goddess personally appeared in the middle of a Bagwal battle to heal the wounds of the warriors with her touch.",
        "keyRituals": [
